abstract: >-
  Long-term monitoring study of a DIY 12V 500Ah LiFePO₄ battery bank 
  demonstrating "architectural immunity" - the principle that parallel-connected 
  mixed-brand cells achieve monolithic behavior through topology. Includes 
  94+ days of continuous voltage monitoring, discharge testing, and 
  storage viability analysis.
